The top-level help lists the available subcommands.

  $ chat -help
  Read live chat from streaming platforms
  
    chat SUBCOMMAND
  
  === subcommands ===
  
    stream                     . Interleave Twitch and YouTube chat as it arrives
    twitch                     . Read Twitch chat anonymously
    youtube                    . Read YouTube live chat via the Data API
    version                    . print version information
    help                       . explain a given subcommand (perhaps recursively)
  
